-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב', §1.43 נזקי רכוש
-- Compensation of a state-employed teaching employee for damage to property
-- in the course of work: when the Ministry compensates, what it never
-- compensates, and how a claim goes from the legal adviser to the
-- inter-ministerial committee and on to payment.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `1.43 נזקי רכוש`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2 The section's title line ("property damage of teaching employees who are state employees").

@desc A claim for damage to a teaching employee's property, as far as section 1.43 asks about it.
DECLARE `property claim` HAS
    `a state employee`                              IS A BOOLEAN @desc paid by the Ministry (א.1)
    `in the course of duty`                         IS A BOOLEAN @desc the damage occurred while performing the employee's role (א.1)
    `under the Ministry's responsibility`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.1)
    `caused by the special demands of the role`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.1)
    `caused by the employer's negligence`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.1)
    `kind of property`                              IS A `kind of property`
    `brought to work by the employee`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc the employee's own object or device, brought to the workplace (א.2ג)
    `insured by the employee`                       IS A BOOLEAN @desc covered by the employee's own insurance policy (א.2ז)
    `took all reasonable measures`                  IS A BOOLEAN @desc took every reasonable step to prevent the loss, including telling the direct superior of a foreseeable danger (א.2ד)
    `took the precautions for eyewear`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc e.g. tied the glasses (א.2ה)
    `standard value at the asset's age`             IS A NUMBER  @desc the value of a standard object of that kind at the age of the damaged asset (א.1 ¶2); an input
    `amount of the damage`                          IS A NUMBER  @desc per the repair receipt or the quotation (א.4ד)

DECLARE `kind of property` IS ONE OF
    `valuables`
    `money`
    `glasses, contact lenses or other visual aids`
    `the employee's car`
    `work tool supplied by the Ministry`
    `other property`

-- The section's parties: the Ministry and the employee from common; the
-- Ministry's legal adviser, the inter-ministerial committee and the Ministry's
-- finance division are this section's own.
DECLARE `1.43 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party
    `the Ministry's legal adviser`
    `the inter-ministerial committee`
    `the Ministry's finance division`

DECLARE `property-claim action` IS ONE OF
    `apply to the legal adviser's office`
    `transfer the claim to the inter-ministerial committee`
    `notify the employee of the decision`
    `transfer the payment decision to the finance division`
    `pay the compensation` HAS `compensation paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `א.1 When the Ministry compensates`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the damage is of a compensable kind under א.1` c IF
        c's `a state employee`
    AND (    (    c's `in the course of duty`
              AND c's `under the Ministry's responsibility`
              AND c's `caused by the special demands of the role`)
         OR c's `caused by the employer's negligence`)

-- א.1 ¶2: the compensation is partial, based on the value of standard
-- objects and on the age of the asset. The committee fixes the amount; the
-- rule is its ceiling.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_1/p2
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `compensation ceiling` c IS
    min (c's `standard value at the asset's age`) (c's `amount of the damage`)

§§ `א.2 What the Ministry does not compensate`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded as valuables` c IF
    c's `kind of property` EQUALS `valuables`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded as money` c IF
    c's `kind of property` EQUALS `money`

-- א.2ג: the employee's own objects brought to work are not compensated,
-- even if used for the role (work tools come from the Ministry only).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_c
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded as brought to work under א.2ג` c IF
    c's `brought to work by the employee`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_d akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_d/p2
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded for want of reasonable measures` c IF
    NOT c's `took all reasonable measures`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_e
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `eyewear compensated under א.2ה` c IF
        c's `kind of property` EQUALS `glasses, contact lenses or other visual aids`
    AND c's `took the precautions for eyewear`

-- א.2ו: no liability for the employee's car. Its pointer, "ראה גם ב-ב'
-- להלן", has nothing to point at (F-1.43-a).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_f
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded as the employee's car` c IF
    c's `kind of property` EQUALS `the employee's car`

-- F-1.43-a: the section's clauses are lettered; only א is there.
`the clauses the section prints` MEANS LIST "א"
`the section has no clause ב for א.2ו to point at` MEANS
    NOT elem "ב" `the clauses the section prints`
#ASSERT `the section has no clause ב for א.2ו to point at`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2__cls_g
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded as insured` c IF
    c's `insured by the employee`

-- F-1.43-b: eyewear the employee wears to work is his own object brought to
-- the workplace, so א.2ג excludes it and א.2ה compensates it. The reading
-- adopted: א.2ה is the specific rule and an exception to א.2ג.
GIVEN c IS A `property claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded by א.2` c IF
        `excluded as valuables` c
    OR  `excluded as money` c
    OR  (`excluded as brought to work under א.2ג` c AND NOT `eyewear compensated under א.2ה` c)
    OR  `excluded for want of reasonable measures` c
    OR  (    c's `kind of property` EQUALS `glasses, contact lenses or other visual aids`
         AND NOT c's `took the precautions for eyewear`)
    OR  `excluded as the employee's car` c
    OR  `excluded as insured` c

@export The ceiling of the compensation the Ministry may pay a state-employed teaching employee for property damaged at work under section 1.43 (0 when the claim is excluded)
GIVEN c IS A `property claim` @desc the claim
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `compensable amount` c IS
    IF `the damage is of a compensable kind under א.1` c AND NOT `excluded by א.2` c
    THEN `compensation ceiling` c
    ELSE 0

§§ `א.3-א.6 The procedure`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_3/p2
DECLARE `committee seat` IS ONE OF
    `the head of the labour-disputes department of the State Attorney, chair`
    `a representative of the Accountant General, member`
    `a representative of the Ministry's legal adviser, member`
    `a representative of the National Insurance Institute, member`

`the inter-ministerial committee's members` MEANS
    LIST `the head of the labour-disputes department of the State Attorney, chair`,
         `a representative of the Accountant General, member`,
         `a representative of the Ministry's legal adviser, member`,
         `a representative of the National Insurance Institute, member`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4
DECLARE `claim documents` HAS
    `personal details`                        IS A BOOLEAN @desc ID number, address, telephone, the institution's name, type and address (א.4א)
    `the principal's account of the event`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.4ב)
    `police complaint or why none was made`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.4ג)
    `original repair receipt or quotation`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.4ד)
    `explanation of the causal link`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.4ה)
    `insurance policy with the cover and deductible clauses` IS A BOOLEAN @desc (א.4ו)

-- א.4: the employee applies to the legal adviser's office with the documents
-- below; the claim then moves to the legal adviser (א.5).
GIVEN d IS A `claim documents`, `causal link found` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.43 party` `property-claim action`
DECIDE `applying for compensation` d `causal link found` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `apply to the legal adviser's office`
    HENCE `the legal adviser's transfer` d `causal link found`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_a akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_b akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_c akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_d akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_e
GIVEN d IS A `claim documents`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the claim documents are complete` d IF
        d's `personal details`
    AND d's `the principal's account of the event`
    AND d's `police complaint or why none was made`
    AND d's `original repair receipt or quotation`
    AND d's `explanation of the causal link`
    AND d's `insurance policy with the cover and deductible clauses`

-- F-1.43-c: א.4ו asks for the policy's deductible clause, which matters only
-- if the deductible could be compensated; א.2ז says an insured object is not
-- compensated at all. The reading adopted is א.2ז's (`excluded as insured`);
-- the deductible is read as asked for the committee's information.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4__cls_f
`an insured pair of glasses with a deductible` MEANS
    `property claim` WITH
        `a state employee`                          IS TRUE
        `in the course of duty`                     IS TRUE
        `under the Ministry's responsibility`       IS TRUE
        `caused by the special demands of the role` IS TRUE
        `caused by the employer's negligence`       IS FALSE
        `kind of property`                          IS `glasses, contact lenses or other visual aids`
        `brought to work by the employee`           IS TRUE
        `insured by the employee`                   IS TRUE
        `took all reasonable measures`              IS TRUE
        `took the precautions for eyewear`          IS TRUE
        `standard value at the asset's age`         IS 600
        `amount of the damage`                      IS 800

`the deductible is asked for although an insured object gets nothing` MEANS
    `compensable amount` `an insured pair of glasses with a deductible` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the deductible is asked for although an insured object gets nothing`

-- א.5: with all the material in, and once satisfied of the causal link, the
-- legal adviser passes the claim to the inter-ministerial committee.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_5
GIVEN d IS A `claim documents`, `causal link found` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.43 party` `property-claim action`
DECIDE `the legal adviser's transfer` d `causal link found` IS
    IF `the claim documents are complete` d AND `causal link found`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry's legal adviser`
         MUST  `transfer the claim to the inter-ministerial committee`
         HENCE `after the committee's decision` TRUE
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry's legal adviser` BECAUSE "1.43 א.5: a complete claim with a causal link goes to the inter-ministerial committee"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- א.6: the employee is notified of the decision; a decision to pay goes to
-- the Ministry's finance division to carry out.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_2__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN `the committee decided to pay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.43 party` `property-claim action`
DECIDE `after the committee's decision` `the committee decided to pay` IS
    (PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `notify the employee of the decision`
     LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "1.43 א.6: the employee is notified of the committee's decision")
    RAND
    (IF `the committee decided to pay`
     THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
          MUST  `transfer the payment decision to the finance division`
          LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "1.43 א.6: a decision to pay goes to the finance division"
     ELSE FULFILLED)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_43__hc_3/p1 A source: director-general's circular נג/1.

-- Worked examples; the values are placeholders.
`a coat torn in a school activity` MEANS
    `property claim` WITH
        `a state employee`                          IS TRUE
        `in the course of duty`                     IS TRUE
        `under the Ministry's responsibility`       IS TRUE
        `caused by the special demands of the role` IS TRUE
        `caused by the employer's negligence`       IS FALSE
        `kind of property`                          IS `other property`
        `brought to work by the employee`           IS FALSE
        `insured by the employee`                   IS FALSE
        `took all reasonable measures`              IS TRUE
        `took the precautions for eyewear`          IS FALSE
        `standard value at the asset's age`         IS 300
        `amount of the damage`                      IS 500

`glasses tied and broken in a playground duty` MEANS
    `property claim` WITH
        `a state employee`                          IS TRUE
        `in the course of duty`                     IS TRUE
        `under the Ministry's responsibility`       IS TRUE
        `caused by the special demands of the role` IS TRUE
        `caused by the employer's negligence`       IS FALSE
        `kind of property`                          IS `glasses, contact lenses or other visual aids`
        `brought to work by the employee`           IS TRUE
        `insured by the employee`                   IS FALSE
        `took all reasonable measures`              IS TRUE
        `took the precautions for eyewear`          IS TRUE
        `standard value at the asset's age`         IS 600
        `amount of the damage`                      IS 800

#ASSERT `compensable amount` `a coat torn in a school activity` EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `compensable amount` `glasses tied and broken in a playground duty` EQUALS 600

-- F-1.43-b's evidence: the same glasses are excluded by א.2ג and
-- compensated by א.2ה.
`eyewear brought to work falls under both א.2ג and א.2ה` MEANS
        `excluded as brought to work under א.2ג` `glasses tied and broken in a playground duty`
    AND `eyewear compensated under א.2ה` `glasses tied and broken in a playground duty`
#ASSERT `eyewear brought to work falls under both א.2ג and א.2ה`

`a complete file` MEANS
    `claim documents` WITH
        `personal details`                        IS TRUE
        `the principal's account of the event`    IS TRUE
        `police complaint or why none was made`   IS TRUE
        `original repair receipt or quotation`    IS TRUE
        `explanation of the causal link`          IS TRUE
        `insurance policy with the cover and deductible clauses` IS TRUE

#TRACE `the legal adviser's transfer` `a complete file` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry's legal adviser` DOES `transfer the claim to the inter-ministerial committee` AT 1
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` DOES `notify the employee of the decision` AT 2
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` DOES `transfer the payment decision to the finance division` AT 2
